;\" width=\"300\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f0f0ff\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:3px;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" style=\"color:#000066;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;\">Acoustic Modeling with Delay</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"tOoLtIp00\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:1010;left:0px;top:0px;width:300px;visibility:hidden;-moz-opacity:1;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000040\" style=\"background:#000040;\" width=\"300\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#f0f0ff\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:3px;\" align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" style=\"color:#000066;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;\">A Software Delay Line</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<!--Navigation Panel-->\n<strong>\n<a name=\"tex2html2063\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Software_Delay_Line.html\">Next</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html2053\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Acoustic_Modeling_Digital_Delay.html\">Prev</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a name=\"tex2html2059\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Acoustic_Modeling_Digital_Delay.html\">Up</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos/pasp/pasp.html\">Top</a> \n\t\t&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a name=\"tex2html2061\" href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Index_this_Document.html\">Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/GlobalJOSIndex.html\">JOS Index</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pubs.html\">JOS Pubs</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/%7Ejos\">JOS Home</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/index.html#searchform\">Search</a>\n</strong>\n<hr>\n\n<!--End of Navigation Panel-->\n\n<h2><a name=\"SECTION00310000000000000000\"></a><a name=\"sec:delaylines\"></a><a name=\"9713\"></a>\n<br>\n<a href=\"http://ccrma.stanford.edu/realsimple/Delay/Delay_lines.html\">Delay Lines</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>\nThe <i>delay line</i><a name=\"9678\"></a> is an elementary functional\nunit which models <i>acoustic <a href=\"http://ccrma.stanford.edu/realsimple/travelingwaves\">propagation</a> delay</i>.  It is a\nfundamental building block of both <a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Acoustic_Modeling_Delay.html\">delay-effects</a> processors and\ndigital-<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/wg.html\">waveguide synthesis</a> models.  The function of a delay line is\nto introduce a time delay between its input and output, as shown in\nFig.<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/Delay_Lines.html#fig:delay\">2.1</a>.\n\n</p><p>\n\n</p><div align=\"CENTER\">\n\n<p><a name=\"fig:delay\"></a></p>\t<img width=\"407\" height=\"36\" align=\"BOTTOM\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/img36.png\" alt=\"\\includegraphics{eps/delay}\"> <div align=\"CENTER\">        <img width=\"785\" height=\"33\" align=\"MIDDLE\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/pasp/img35.png\" alt=\"% latex2html id marker 79492\n$\\textstyle \\parbox{\\twidth }{\\caption{\\protect\\small The $M$-sample delay line.}}$\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>\nLet the input <a href=\"http://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/filters/Definition_Signal.html\">signal</a> be denoted <span class=\"MATH\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2026\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>\u2026</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and let the\ndelay-line length be <span class=\"MATH\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> samples.  Then the output signal <span class=\"MATH\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is\nspecified by the relation\n<a name=\"eq:dlde\"></a></p><p></p>\n<div class=\"MATHDISPLAY\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" width=\"full\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; min-width: 18.965em; position: relative;\"><mjx-math width=\"full\" display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtable width=\"full\" side=\"right\" style=\"min-width: 18.965em;\"><mjx-table style=\"width: auto; min-width: 14.809em; margin: 0px 2.078em;\"><mjx-itable width=\"full\"><mjx-mlabeledtr><mjx-mtd><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi